### Enregistrer le token FCM
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/fcm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "token": "fcm_token_here_1234567890abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ"
}

### Enregistrer l'App ID OneSignal
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/onesignal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "appId": "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012"
}

### Enregistrer les deux tokens simultanément
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/both
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "fcmToken": "fcm_token_here_1234567890abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ",
  "oneSignalAppId": "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012"
}

### Vérifier le statut des tokens
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Envoyer une notification de test
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/test
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "🧪 Test personnalisé",
  "body": "Ceci est mon test de notification personnalisé"
}

### Supprimer tous les tokens (déconnexion)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/clear
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test avec token FCM invalide (doit échouer)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/fcm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "token": "invalid_token"
}

### Test avec Player ID OneSignal invalide (doit échouer)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/onesignal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "playerId": "invalid_player_id"
}

### Test avec tokens vides (doit échouer)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/both
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "fcmToken": "",
  "oneSignalAppId": ""
}

